# mattpocock.manifest — the skills to install by default from the
# 3rdparty/mattpocock submodule (github.com/mattpocock/skills, MIT).
#
# One skill directory per line, relative to the submodule root. Each must
# contain a SKILL.md. install.sh installs each under its basename alongside
# the first-party skills. Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Curation is deliberate: upstream also ships deprecated/, in-progress/, and
# personal/ skills we don't want auto-installed. To adopt more, add their
# paths here (see `ls 3rdparty/mattpocock/skills/*/`).

skills/engineering/setup-matt-pocock-skills
skills/engineering/research
skills/engineering/wizard
skills/productivity/handoff
skills/productivity/teach
skills/productivity/grill-me
skills/productivity/grilling
skills/productivity/wait-what
skills/productivity/writing-for-agents
